WEBVTT

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:07.860
<i>Out on the evening streets, I saw my mom.</i>

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.990
<i>Clad in her usual shrine maiden attire,</i>

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:14.990
<i>she moved slowly through the
twilight, as if she were drifting.</i>

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:19.580
<i>Upon seeing her, before I had a chance to question it,</i>

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.790
<i>I was overcome with joy from seeing her after so long</i>

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:25.130
<i>and immediately called out to her.</i>

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:31.930
<i>But Mom kept on walking, not turning around even once.</i>

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:34.510
<i>I hurriedly chased after her.</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:37.270
<i>Mom rounded a corner, and I followed.</i>

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:38.520
<i>But when I did...</i>

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:41.770
<i>nobody was there.</i>

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:43.940
<i>Was I imagining things?</i>

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:46.070
<i>Indeed, I must have been.</i>

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:49.700
<i>There is no way my mom could have been there.</i>

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:51.490
<i>After all...</i>

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:52.620
<i>my mom is...</i>

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:02.170
<i>Right then, the dim street lights started flickering and gleaming</i>

00:01:02.170 --> 00:01:05.550
<i>and their fluorescent lamps
radiated pale white light,</i>

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:08.800
<i>bathing mom's back in faint illumination.</i>

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.340
<i>With the sound of her staff
echoing down the street,</i>

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:15.680
<i>the faint odor of fragrant and
medicinal herbs spread through the air.</i>

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:19.350
<i>That smell was the familiar scent of my mom.</i>

00:01:20.230 --> 00:01:22.900
<i>As each of the street lights flickered on and off,</i>

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:27.610
<i>the figure of my mom appeared and disappeared in turn.</i>

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:34.950
<i>but every time the street lights flickered on again,</i>

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:38.080
<i>my mom appeared farther and farther away.</i>

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:41.210
<i>Although I desperately ran
after her, I couldn't catch up.</i>

00:01:41.210 --> 00:01:43.540
<i>My mom was slowly taking step after step,</i>

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:45.920
<i>and each time the street lights flickered,</i>

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:48.800
<i>she faded away into the distance, moving beyond my reach.</i>

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:52.840
<i>I, in fear of never seeing her again,</i>

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:55.090
<i>called out to my mom loudly.</i>

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:59.970
<i>When I did, Mom turned back toward me.</i>

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:04.900
<i>Momentarily, a blinding flash of light illuminated the street.</i>

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:07.400
<i>That must have been the filaments breaking.</i>

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:08.820
<i>Their light was gone,</i>

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:11.570
<i>and my mom had disappeared into the darkness.</i>

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:15.910
<i>Unable to comprehend what had just happened,</i>

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:17.830
<i>I simply stood there, dumbfounded.</i>

00:02:18.370 --> 00:02:21.410
<i>No matter how much sentiment, how much love,</i>

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:23.410
<i>how much longing I had for her,</i>

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:26.920
<i>I knew I would never be able to see my mom again.</i>

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:29.920
<i>Yet I had just seen her with my own eyes.</i>

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:35.180
<i>I knew there was absolutely
no chance of that really happening.</i>

00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:36.340
<i>After all...</i>

00:02:38.180 --> 00:02:40.640
<i>my mom already...</i>

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:19.110
Hey, Kagami!

00:04:19.490 --> 00:04:20.570
Kagami!

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:24.740
What do you want?

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:27.120
I am currently taking my important morning nap.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:29.250
Please don't disturb me.

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:31.500
Kagami, listen!

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.710
<i>You</i> should try listening to <i>me</i>.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:35.710
I saw my mom yesterday.

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:37.840
Give me a break.

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:39.090
Yesterday...

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:41.180
I...

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:44.510
Are you stupid? Do you want me to kill you?

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:47.600
I didn't mean you should break up your sentences.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:51.350
Anyway, I have no time for such pointless chatter.

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:54.360
Please don't disturb my sleep.

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:57.610
In that case, Kagami, shop with me after school.

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:59.200
Where did that come from?

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:01.740
Well, I'm going to buy a bike.

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:03.370
I want you to help me choose one.

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:05.830
I don't see any logical train of thought.

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:07.700
You're too spontaneous.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:10.830
I don't want to make my big brother keep taking me to school every day,

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:12.500
and they get mad when we ride on one bike.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:13.130
As I said...

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:16.590
Kagami, come and choose one for me.

00:05:16.590 --> 00:05:21.720
Unfortunately, I need to take Meat-chan for a physical examination today.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:22.680
Meat-chan?

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:23.600
That's right!

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:28.180
She's a lovely creature who's white, soft, and fluffy.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:31.480
She'll die from loneliness if she's left alone,

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:33.980
so I must be with her.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:36.730
I'm like that too!

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.480
I just can't go today.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:42.030
It should be fun to have an adventure by yourself once in a while.

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.990
Kagami's so cruel.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:49.750
She cares about me as much as she does a rabbit?

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:51.370
That's just ridiculous.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.720
Mom?

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:10.430
What are you up to, Sasami? Shopping?

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:11.100
Huh?

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:12.730
Y-Yeah.

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:14.480
What are you buying?

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:16.610
Um, well...

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:18.020
a bike.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:19.440
I see.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:20.990
If it's for riding to and from school,

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:23.990
you should buy one with a basket, like that.

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:25.870
What? No! That won't look cute.

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:29.870
A Tsukuyomi shrine maiden
does not need cuteness.

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:34.830
Seeking relief and comfort from external objects will become your weakness.

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:37.340
Likewise, having things you like and dislike

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:42.510
serves only as an encumbrance, dulling the decisiveness
you need to manage the world correctly.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:49.350
I don't have many memories of my mom,
but I remember the few I do have very well.

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:52.310
She taught me skills and techniques and had me develop them.

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:56.480
When I was little, I never left my mother's side.

00:06:57.860 --> 00:06:59.820
Is something the matter, Sasami?

00:06:59.820 --> 00:07:01.610
No, it's nothing.

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:06.450
What is this thing making that constant noise?

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:07.990
Oh, this here...

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:10.990
You use these buttons to move the crane,

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:14.330
and you fetch a stuffed doll from inside.

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:15.040
Wanna try it?

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:17.040
Dolls are wicked.

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:21.380
As it's easy to implant a soul into a figure that resembles a living creature,

00:07:21.380 --> 00:07:24.920
it's likely to be a spiritual item set up by an opposing faction.

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:26.010
All right.

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:28.600
Listen to what I tell you!

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:31.640
Damn, this is difficult.

00:07:31.640 --> 00:07:33.770
Leave it to me.

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:38.810
You can't do that!

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:41.730
For a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden, speed is foremost.

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:42.780
You're breaking the rules!

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:45.110
The store clerks are staring at us!

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:51.240
Then I'll cast a spell to move the doll itself.

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:55.000
It fell.

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:57.120
Is this really okay?

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:58.330
I will allow it.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:07:59.670
Permission granted by a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden is equivalent to a god's—

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:01.500
Shoot, the store clerks are coming.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:02.750
Let's go, Mom!

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:05.010
Don't start running so suddenly!

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:06.970
I'm not very athletic!

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:10.140
My mom was frail from birth

00:08:10.140 --> 00:08:12.010
and fell ill frequently.

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:15.100
I often used to stay with her to nurse her.

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:18.850
Jeez, we could've been caught!

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:22.150
A Tsukuyomi shrine maiden will never yield to governmental authority.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:26.070
Your mother wishes to rest.

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:28.780
Mom, you're even more out of shape than me?

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:30.280
You might be in trouble.

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:33.830
I simply don't see the point in having physical strength.

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:36.580
Wait here a minute.

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:38.370
Here.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:41.250
I sense a disturbing chill.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:42.170
What is that?

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:43.500
Ice cream.

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:45.130
It's a type of cold snack.

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:48.050
It's sinful to indulge oneself in treats.

00:08:48.050 --> 00:08:48.680
All form of pleasure will only amplify your bias toward—

00:08:48.680 --> 00:08:49.880
Just try it!
All form of pleasure will only amplify your bias toward—

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:50.840
All form of pleasure will only amplify your bias toward—

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:54.100
That's cold!

00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:56.930
You sounded so cute just now!

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:59.810
I am always cute.

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:03.980
This isn't bad.

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:10.490
Do you have a computer, Mom?

00:09:10.490 --> 00:09:12.120
It's handy to have one.

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:15.240
A Tsukuyomi shrine maiden places no value on convenience.

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:17.370
Mom, I want this!

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:18.500
Denied.

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:20.250
Worldly desires are sinful.

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:23.000
Onii-chan would've bought it for me.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:24.670
Don't bring him up.

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:25.840
Don't rely on him.

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:27.130
Your mind will rot.

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:29.130
Mom, I'll pick out some clothes for you.

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:31.760
You must be sick of wearing that shrine maiden stuff.

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:35.050
Being a shrine maiden, it is only natural that I wear this.

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:37.020
I need no clothes from the secular world.

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:42.770
That was fun!

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:44.650
Are you okay for time, Mom?

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:46.690
Do you wanna have dinner with me?

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:49.360
You used to be just a baby who
couldn't do a thing on your own,

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:51.950
yet now, you're even trying to lead me.

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:53.280
Anything you wanna eat?

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:54.370
That will not be necessary.

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:57.410
More importantly, I have
something to tell y—

00:09:57.410 --> 00:09:59.040
Oh, how about some Italian?

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:00.410
You've never had it, have you?

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:02.580
Wait, Sasami!

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:03.540
I told you to wait!

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:06.540
The last bit of time I spent with her...

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:08.920
To this day, I still think about it every now and then.

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.090
Looky, looky!

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:12.090
There're so many animals!

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:15.300
So many soft, fluffy creatures!

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:16.600
Is this heaven?!

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:20.520
All right, Meat-chan!
We're here to see the doctor.

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:23.940
There's nothing to be afraid of, so keep quiet, okay?

00:10:23.940 --> 00:10:27.270
Having the rabbit be your baby for your sexual roleplay? Impressive, Kagami!

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:28.610
That's my sister!

00:10:28.610 --> 00:10:31.280
You're annoying. I wish you'd die.

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:36.320
The soft, fluffy creatures are wearing dresses!

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:38.700
Th-This...

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:43.670
This must be the heavens telling me to be lovey-dovey with my Meat-chan!

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:45.380
I don't think so.

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:48.500
Oh, Meat-chan, what do you think?

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.460
Looks like we'll be here for a while.

00:10:58.350 --> 00:10:59.350
Sasami.

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:00.720
What is it?

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:03.600
Who feeds you here?

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:05.770
Usually, Onii-chan would.

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:10.230
Don't worry! It's simple.

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:11.030
Look.

00:11:11.030 --> 00:11:12.490
Do it like this and...

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:20.080
That aside, Sasami...

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:21.370
I have something to tell you.

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:23.750
What is it?

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:30.420
You said it was fun.

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:33.340
That makes me content, Sasami.

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:42.850
Thinking back, we've never gone shopping, chatted,
and spent time together like this as others do.

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:46.350
I was not a good mother.

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:48.610
I apologize, Sasami.

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:50.230
Oh no...

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:55.950
Don't apologize, Mom.

00:11:55.950 --> 00:11:57.700
I'm happy.

00:11:57.700 --> 00:12:00.950
We got to spend some time
together today, at least.

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:04.450
I always dreamed we'd do something like this.

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:08.830
I must've made you feel lonely.

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:10.250
It's okay.

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:13.050
I know that you have your hands full with your duties

00:12:13.050 --> 00:12:17.970
and that you tried your best to raise me as your successor.

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:19.590
Sasami...

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:24.020
Thank you. I'm really grateful.

00:12:24.520 --> 00:12:25.770
I love you, Mom!

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:34.860
Even so, because I love you so much, I must tell you this one thing.

00:12:34.860 --> 00:12:35.650
What is it?

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:41.620
After all, Mom, you already...

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:43.740
passed away.

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:58.550
I'm dead, you say?

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.220
Sasami...

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:06.890
Did you think I hadn't noticed that?

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:10.020
Of course I'm a dead person.

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:11.940
Mom...

00:13:11.940 --> 00:13:12.650
Then...

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:15.940
A Transformation has temporarily restored my appearance,

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:18.400
but this body is a corpse.

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:20.700
It is gradually rotting.

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:23.780
It's simply that other people cannot notice.

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:29.330
This is the reality of my appearance.

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:37.550
All humans eventually die.

00:13:38.090 --> 00:13:41.180
The souls of the dead descend

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:42.800
and head on into the netherworld.

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:47.060
One cannot be reborn, nor can one be revived.

00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:48.430
Those are the rules.

00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:51.640
However, there is a way out.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:55.650
Before I ate the fruit of the underworld,

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:59.400
that is to say, before I became a citizen of the world of the dead,

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:02.200
I negotiated with the king of the netherworld.

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:04.530
We agreed upon a deal that was of mutual benefit,

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:08.160
and upon the condition that I will return once my body rots completely,

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:10.870
I was allowed to return to this world.

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:12.250
Why did you...

00:14:12.670 --> 00:14:16.960
Even the god who created this world can't break those rules!

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:20.590
You would like to know why, Sasami?

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:24.590
I would've left with no regrets.

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:27.850
But I saw it.

00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:32.890
You ran out of the shrine, abandoned
your duty as a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden,

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:34.850
and lived a life of indulgence.

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:39.110
I couldn't stay dead.

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:40.900
I clearly remember telling you:

00:14:41.320 --> 00:14:42.900
"I'm counting on you to manage this world."

00:14:43.780 --> 00:14:45.700
And you nodded,

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:47.490
upon which you said,

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:49.660
"Leave it to me, Mom."

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:52.410
However, you broke that promise.

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:54.830
I won't blame you for that.

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:57.420
You're not the only one who has committed sin.

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:00.800
Before your efforts came to fruition, before your training was complete,

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:04.220
before you were ready for your duty, I died.

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:05.680
I, too, am responsible.

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:10.810
Return to the Tsukuyomi Shrine, Sasami.

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:13.430
You need to begin your training anew.

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:15.690
The shrine was destroyed.

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:17.690
I am aware of that.

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:20.190
The structure is not what matters.

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:22.150
You need only gain distance from this meaningless secular realm

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:24.820
and be in an environment where you can train in peace.

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:26.070
Let us go back.

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:26.950
No!

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:29.660
I'm not going back!

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:34.460
We don't need to spit up blood and cry just to maintain a world that's good for humans!

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:36.960
I'm not a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden anymore!

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:39.090
Do not misunderstand what I have meant, Sasami.

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:41.920
Your opinion was not what I asked for.

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:44.220
It's for the sake of humankind.

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:48.340
Are you saying your happiness, freedom, and comfort

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:51.140
are worth more than the future of the human race?

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:56.190
You carry more than just the weight of your own life upon your shoulders.

00:15:56.190 --> 00:16:00.270
And it is not your life, but something much more immense and sublime.

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:02.230
End your selfish grumbling!

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:03.230
No way...

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:05.110
Grow up, you fool!

00:16:05.490 --> 00:16:07.360
You can't stay a child forever!

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:11.700
If you're not a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden, your life is worthless.

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:14.410
Living without purpose,
neglecting your duties,

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:17.120
and indulging in a slothful lifestyle are sins!

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:18.630
Why won't you understand?!

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:23.670
I shouldn't have pampered
you when I raised you.

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:25.880
You stupid girl!

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:26.880
Hey!

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:31.010
Don't get too worked up, ma'am.

00:16:33.060 --> 00:16:35.770
How about a three-way conversation...

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:37.560
ma'am?

00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:38.560
Tsurugi...

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:41.980
I've heard of one, but it's
my first time seeing one.

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:44.530
You came back from the netherworld all on your own, huh?

00:16:44.530 --> 00:16:48.110
Do not mimic the speech of human beings.
You're just an evil god.

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:53.330
You must've snatched Sasami with your wicked smile and tempting sweet-talk.

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:55.450
I'm no evil god.

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:58.210
<i>You're</i> the monster who came back from the other world.

00:16:58.210 --> 00:17:02.250
Not even gods, let alone humans, may return.

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:05.760
That's the rule that old guy set for this world.

00:17:05.760 --> 00:17:09.380
The limited lifetime motivates everyone to live their lives to the fullest.

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:15.010
I'm a lazy bum who gave up the
responsibility of managing this world,

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:19.640
but even I can't overlook such
a blatant violation of the rules.

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.400
I'll have to set things straight.

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:24.690
No one tempted Sasami.

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:26.730
She chose her own way to live.

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:29.400
You left her alone and died.

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:32.950
Don't just come out of nowhere and try to be mommy again!

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:36.370
I'll send you back to the netherworld right now!

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:38.330
You underestimate me.

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:44.750
I reign supreme at the Tsukuyomi Shrine,
which destroys all kinds of wicked beings.

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:48.510
As a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden,
exterminating evil gods is my specialty.

00:17:49.470 --> 00:17:51.930
I ain't no evil god!

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:55.140
So, your mythical fighting prowess was overstated, Sun Goddess?

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:00.600
Tsurugi!

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:03.770
Nee-san!

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:04.360
Tsurugi-nee!

00:18:04.360 --> 00:18:05.360
Don't get involved!

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:06.820
She's strong!

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:08.230
You guys won't stand a chance!

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:10.650
Please don't take action by yourself.

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:14.120
Without your true power,
you're just an empty shell!

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:15.370
Shut up!

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:20.870
I couldn't call myself a teacher if I didn't
try to stop a parent hitting their child!

00:18:21.210 --> 00:18:23.580
You all disappoint me.

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:26.920
The gods of this country are too hedonistic.

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:29.630
I can't leave you to take care of it.

00:18:30.260 --> 00:18:35.010
Only under the management of humans will this world develop and flourish.

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:37.510
It's all for the sake of the world, for the sake of humanity.

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:45.770
My final duty is to educate Sasami so that she may
fulfill her responsibilities as a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden.

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:48.650
I don't hold anything against you, but if you're going to interfere,

00:18:49.280 --> 00:18:50.400
I'll have to kill you.

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:53.320
I'm not going to the netherworld!

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:55.660
Someone I can't stand is there!

00:18:57.830 --> 00:18:58.580
What?

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:01.830
As expected of the divine sword, Gathering Clouds of Heaven.

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:03.460
I must admit, it's quite powerful.

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:06.500
However, it's ultimately a sword that serves only to protect.

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:10.800
A weed cutter used for protection lacks
the evil will needed to destroy the enemy.

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:12.220
Could that be...

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:16.180
Once broken by a curse upon defeating the Great Eight-forked Serpent,

00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:18.890
this sword of misfortune has been honed in the land of the dead.

00:19:18.890 --> 00:19:20.430
Its name is the Slash of Heavenly Wings.

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:23.980
It's a god-slaying demon sword I received from the king of the netherworld.

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:27.690
The Slash of Heavenly Wings? The king of the netherworld?

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:28.940
So <i>that's</i> what's going on!

00:19:28.940 --> 00:19:32.780
I knew she was too strong for
a human being. Now it makes sense.

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:35.990
That damn mama's boy is trying to fuck with me!

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:41.040
Nee-san!

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:42.870
How dare you?!

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:45.670
Impossible!

00:19:46.170 --> 00:19:48.170
Under the protection of the king of the netherworld,

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:51.590
I hold this demon sword made divine.

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:54.420
You cannot lay a finger upon me!

00:19:58.430 --> 00:19:59.640
Kagami-nee!

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:00.390
Kagami!

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:08.900
You bitch!

00:20:08.900 --> 00:20:10.980
You are too weak.

00:20:13.360 --> 00:20:17.660
As I am one who has returned from the other world, paths leading there tend to emerge around me.

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:22.370
Once one falls down into the underworld,

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:24.700
it's next to impossible for even a god to return.

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:35.760
Your time ended long ago, Sun Goddess.

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:39.010
Time to set and hand dominion of the world to the Moon.

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:42.640
Now...

00:20:46.520 --> 00:20:48.270
Back off, little one.

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:56.950
You might enjoy protecting that selfish girl

00:20:56.950 --> 00:21:01.320
and pretending you are fighting on the side of justice,

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:04.160
but it has no meaning, and it has no worth.

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:08.790
For the world, for humanity, Sasami must be a capable shrine maiden

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:12.290
so she will be able to guide
this world in the right direction.

00:21:12.840 --> 00:21:16.970
I'm too dumb to really understand,

00:21:16.970 --> 00:21:19.970
but why are you being mean?!

00:21:19.970 --> 00:21:22.300
Everyone was happy for once!

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:24.560
Tsurugi-nee looked like she was having fun!

00:21:24.560 --> 00:21:27.730
Kagami-nee began to smile a lot!

00:21:27.730 --> 00:21:29.310
All thanks to Mamarin!

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:33.400
So I don't get what you're talking about!

00:21:33.400 --> 00:21:34.940
I don't understand!

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:37.070
Then I'll make it easy for you to understand.

00:21:37.820 --> 00:21:39.070
You are in my way.

00:21:40.410 --> 00:21:41.530
Stop it!

00:21:41.530 --> 00:21:42.820
Stop it already!

00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:43.780
I'll go back!

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:45.540
I'll go back to the shrine!

00:21:45.540 --> 00:21:49.040
I'll be a Tsukuyomi shrine maiden again, so stop this!

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:50.290
So please...

00:21:58.210 --> 00:21:59.050
Welcome back...

00:21:59.470 --> 00:22:01.300
to the human world.

00:22:13.480 --> 00:22:16.070
It's that time again!

00:22:16.070 --> 00:22:17.820
Time for the ending theme!

00:22:17.820 --> 00:22:23.240
Today for sure, I'm going to get
Sasami-san to sing for your enjoyment!

00:22:23.240 --> 00:22:28.450
Or at least that's what I thought.
Things are looking too serious for that.

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:30.370
Oh, why did this have to happen?

00:22:30.370 --> 00:22:33.630
Do I have to do this alone again?

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:36.630
What is it?

00:22:36.630 --> 00:22:38.840
Mom, perfect timing!

00:22:38.840 --> 00:22:40.420
Come over here for a moment!

00:22:40.420 --> 00:22:41.550
What is it you want?

00:22:41.550 --> 00:22:42.550
Here, take this mic.

00:22:42.550 --> 00:22:43.510
Are you ready?

00:22:43.510 --> 00:22:45.800
Now, start singing!

00:22:45.800 --> 00:22:49.100
Wait, I do not understand the situation.

00:22:49.100 --> 00:22:50.770
First of all, I do not sing.

00:22:50.770 --> 00:22:52.230
A Tsukuyomi shrine maiden needs no songs!

00:22:52.230 --> 00:22:54.690
Don't worry about that!

00:22:54.690 --> 00:22:56.730
Since the main episode will be serious this week,

00:22:56.730 --> 00:22:59.780
I think they're cutting out the ending so they won't ruin the atmosphere.

00:23:00.150 --> 00:23:02.950
Even though we're recording this, I don't think it will air.

00:23:02.950 --> 00:23:05.200
But still, please sing just in case.

00:23:05.200 --> 00:23:08.120
Come on! Take a deep breath and go!

00:23:08.790 --> 00:23:14.250
The s-s-symphony?

00:23:14.250 --> 00:23:16.830
A-A light sh-shines...

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:18.710
The thick color...

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:20.800
You will not trick me into doing this!

00:23:20.800 --> 00:23:23.510
Why do I have to do this?!

00:23:23.510 --> 00:23:25.510
Kamiomi, stay where you are and sit up properly.

00:23:25.510 --> 00:23:27.800
I'll cut your head off!

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:31.390
Ouch! Don't hit me with the mic, Mom!

00:23:31.390 --> 00:23:33.100
We need to use that every episode!

00:23:33.100 --> 00:23:35.520
O-Okay then, see you next time!

00:23:42.650 --> 00:23:45.360
All right, it's time for Lazy Exercises!

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:46.910
First, take a deep breath!

00:23:46.910 --> 00:23:50.120
Breath as if you want to inhale as much of Sasami-san's scent as you can!

00:23:50.120 --> 00:23:51.160
One, two...

00:23:52.040 --> 00:23:52.790
Two, two...

00:23:54.040 --> 00:23:56.290
Next, open your arms wide!

00:23:56.290 --> 00:23:58.170
Like you're about to hug Sasami-san!

00:23:58.170 --> 00:24:00.420
Okay. One, two... Sasami-san!

00:24:00.420 --> 00:24:02.170
Two, two... I love you!

00:24:02.170 --> 00:24:04.550
Now you're ready for a productive day!

00:24:04.550 --> 00:24:08.550
Next time, episode seven: "I Forgot How to Speak."
